    (statement "Predeclared target: misaligned judged low must diverge."))
  (limitation "37 finite predeclared witnesses. an aligned access touches one page here and a misaligned one never reaches translation, so no two translation faults compete; that no breakpoint exists is Sdtrig's absence from the selection: the derivation's vocabulary has no trigger CSR to read; this one program holds each pair the statement names, and the guests it names stay in the corpus, each judged by its own expectations")
  (source_id "RVP-MACHINE") (source_locator "§2.1.1.15") (category "implementation-defined") (risk "medium")
  (coverage "37 witnesses: each adjacent pair in one program, the fetch faults over decode and access, illegal over misaligned, translation and access, misaligned over page and access at both directions, the atomics, translation over access, and the physical access last")
